# Repo Structure

- Top-level docs: [README.md](mdc:README.md), [CONTRIBUTING.md](mdc:CONTRIBUTING.md), [LICENSE](mdc:LICENSE)
- Install scripts: [install.sh](mdc:install.sh), [update.sh](mdc:update.sh), [uninstall.sh](mdc:uninstall.sh)
- Script data and deps: [scriptdata/](mdc:scriptdata/)
- Arch packages (PKGBUILDs, prebuilt pkgs): [arch-packages/](mdc:arch-packages/)
- User configs copied to $XDG_CONFIG_HOME: [.config/](mdc:.config/)
  - Hyprland config: [.config/hypr/hyprland/](mdc:.config/hypr/hyprland/)
  - Kitty: [.config/kitty/kitty.conf](mdc:.config/kitty/kitty.conf)
  - Quickshell: [.config/quickshell/](mdc:.config/quickshell/)

# Entry points

- Hyprland loads [hyprland.conf](mdc:.config/hypr/hyprland.conf), which includes files from [.config/hypr/hyprland/](mdc:.config/hypr/hyprland/)
- Keybinds: [.config/hypr/hyprland/keybinds.conf](mdc:.config/hypr/hyprland/keybinds.conf)
- Autostart: [.config/hypr/hyprland/execs.conf](mdc:.config/hypr/hyprland/execs.conf)
- Kitty defaults: [.config/kitty/kitty.conf](mdc:.config/kitty/kitty.conf)
